.TP
.B NTPD_CONFIG
Override configuration file location
.TP
.B NTPD_LOG
Override log file location
.TP
.B NTPD_PID
Override PID file location
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.IP \(bu 2
Run as daemon with default configuration:
.RS
.nf
ntpd
.fi
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
Run in foreground for debugging:
.RS
.nf
ntpd -f -D 2
.fi
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
Run with custom configuration:
.RS
.nf
ntpd -c /etc/ntpd.conf
.fi
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
Run with specific port:
.RS
.nf
ntpd -p 1234
.fi
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
Run with verbose logging:
.RS
.nf
ntpd -f -V
.fi
.RE
.IP \(bu 2
Run with debug level 3:
.RS
.nf
ntpd -f -D 3
.fi
.RE
.RE
